# BLOOM by itself: BLOOM's key (black 7: b6 here) held and ALGO turned right, it swells in now and then by itself
# (rarely, now and then, often), not into the loop; left, by hand again. The tempo is not turned by it.
wait 1000
expect bloom_auto 0
expect blooms 0
key b6 down
wait 100
turn ALGO 3
wait 100
key b6 up
expect bloom_auto 3
expect set_bpm 90
wait 60000
expect blooms >3
expect looper 0
key b6 down
wait 100
turn ALGO -3
wait 100
key b6 up
expect bloom_auto 0
expect clips 0
